@host = http://localhost:5199
@token = paste-an-entra-id-jwt-here

### OpenAPI document (anonymous in Development)
GET {{host}}/openapi/v1.json

### Is the process up?
GET {{host}}/health/live

### Is the database reachable? (runs SELECT 1)
GET {{host}}/health/db

### List MR headers (paged, newest first). Filters all optional.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/mr?page=1&pageSize=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List MR with filters
GET {{host}}/api/v1/mr?customerId=1001&status=1&requestType=Monthly
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### One MR header + all its detail lines
GET {{host}}/api/v1/mr/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Just the detail lines for one MR
GET {{host}}/api/v1/mr/1/details
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
